<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb palladium imports down 10.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb palladium imports down 10.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's palladium imports in February were down 10.4 percent from a year earlier to 9.308 tonnes, Finance Ministry data released on Friday showed.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in kg):</p>
<p>		    Feb 97     Jan 97	  Feb 96</p>
<p> Total	    9,308	 8,156	  10,394</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	   5,911	 5,418	   8,358</p>
<p> South Africa   1,333	 1,474	   1,056</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first two months of 1997 amounted to 17.46 tonnes, up from 12.91 tonnes the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
